Instead of `find` when appropriate\r\n\r\nNot sure if it will improve performance in any of these places specifically but avoiding double lookup is beneficial in general.\r\n\r\nIf any of these cases result in poor readability we can rework them or drop them, some of these cases could benefit from being declared in the if-statement if it has better readability but avoided such for now\r\n\r\nThe change from `find` to `getptr` is in cases where the iterator isn't really necessary and it's redundant to have a full iterator, or access through `E->value` etc.\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/guidelines/code_style.html\r\n-->\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-10-16T18:41:08Z","updated_at":"2026-10-14T15:23:19Z","closed_at":"2025-10-16T19:46:10Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"682379fc7e8cbe38103732f4f22656d602b18a6a","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"AThousandShips:avoid_double_lookup_core","ref":"avoid_